  "body": "## What's Changed\r\n* doc: Add client ID note by @hrkfdn in https://github.com/hrkfdn/ncspot/pull/1880\r\n* chore(toolchain): update by @hrkfdn in https://github.com/hrkfdn/ncspot/pull/1881\r\n* chore(deps): bump notify-rust from 4.18.0 to 4.18.1 in the cargo group by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/hrkfdn/ncspot/pull/1879\r\n* chore(deps): bump the cargo group across 1 directory with 7 updates by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/hrkfdn/ncspot/pull/1892\r\n* chore(toolchain): update by @hrkfdn in https://github.com/hrkfdn/ncspot/pull/1893\r\n* fix: blank screen for 20+ seconds at startup when rate limited by @aw-snap in https://github.com/hrkfdn/ncspot/pull/1886\r\n* fix: keep playing when the Spotify connection drops by @aw-snap in https://github.com/hrkfdn/ncspot/pull/1888\r\n* chore(deps): bump rustls from 0.23.43 to 0.23.45 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/hrkfdn/ncspot/pull/1883\r\n* fix: use the saved credentials when restarting the session by @aw-snap in https://github.com/hrkfdn/ncspot/pull/1889\r\n* perf: reduce constant rate limits by not refetching all liked songs every start by @aw-snap in https://github.com/hrkfdn/ncspot/pull/1887\r\n* chore(deps): bump the cargo group with 3 updates by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/hrkfdn/ncspot/pull/1895\r\n* fix: handle playlists that fail to load by @aw-snap in https://github.com/hrkfdn/ncspot/pull/1884\r\n* chore(ci): Update macOS runner to `latest` by @hrkfdn in https://github.com/hrkfdn/ncspot/pull/1899\r\n* chore(deps): bump rustls from 0.23.45 to 0.23.46 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/hrkfdn/ncspot/pull/1900\r\n* fix(windows): build with crossterm so wide characters render correctly by @luisdavidtrejosrojas in https://github.com/hrkfdn/ncspot/pull/1898\r\n* chore(deps): bump the cargo group with 2 updates by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/hrkfdn/ncspot/pull/1901\r\n* chore: Release 1.5.1 by @hrkfdn in https://github.com/hrkfdn/ncspot/pull/1903\r\n\r\